<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>WIA-SOCIAL Ebook - Universal Social Networking Standard</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico">
    <style>
        :root { --primary: #8B5CF6; --bg: #0f172a; --bg-card: #1e293b; --text: #f8fafc; --text-muted: #94a3b8; --border: #334155; --gold: #ffd700; }
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); min-height: 100vh; line-height: 1.6; }
        .nav { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 15px 30px; background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
        .nav-brand { font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: bold; color: var(--primary); text-decoration: none; }
        .breadcrumb { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; }
        .breadcrumb a { color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none; }
        .lang-toggle { display: flex; gap: 5px; }
        .lang-btn { padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 5px; cursor: pointer; background: var(--bg-card); color: var(--text-muted); border: 1px solid var(--border); text-decoration: none; }
        .lang-btn.active { background: var(--primary); color: white; }
        .hero { text-align: center; padding: 60px 20px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1) 0%, transparent 100%); }
        .hero-emoji { font-size: 60px; animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite; }
        @keyframes pulse { 0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); } 50% { transform: scale(1.1); } }
        .hero h1 { font-size: 2rem; margin: 15px 0 5px; }
        .hero-sub { color: var(--text-muted); }
        .hongik { color: var(--gold); font-size: 1rem; margin-top: 10px; }
        .container { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 30px 20px; }
        .info-box { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 15px; margin: 30px 0; }
        .info-item { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 15px; text-align: center; }
        .info-label { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.8rem; }
        .info-value { font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: bold; color: var(--primary); margin-top: 5px; }
        .chapters { margin: 30px 0; }
        .chapter-card { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 15px; background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-decoration: none; color: var(--text); transition: all 0.3s; }
        .chapter-card:hover { border-color: var(--primary); transform: translateX(5px); }
        .chapter-num { width: 40px; height: 40px; background: var(--primary); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: bold; flex-shrink: 0; }
        .chapter-info h3 { margin-bottom: 5px; }
        .chapter-info p { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; }
        .cta { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 30px; text-align: center; margin: 40px 0; }
        .price { font-size: 2rem; color: var(--primary); font-weight: bold; }
        .btn { display: inline-block; padding: 15px 30px; background: var(--primary); color: white; border-radius: 10px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 15px; }
        .footer { text-align: center; padding: 40px 20px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
        .footer-hongik { color: var(--gold); font-size: 1.2rem; }
        .footer a { color: var(--primary); text-decoration: none; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <nav class="nav">
        <a href="/" class="nav-brand">🤟 WIA</a>
        <span class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> › <a href="/social/">WIA Social</a> › Ebook</span>
        <div class="lang-toggle">
            <span class="lang-btn active">EN</span>
            <a href="../ko/" class="lang-btn">KO</a>
        </div>
    </nav>
    
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-emoji">👥</div>
        <h1>WIA-SOCIAL Standard Guide</h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">Universal Social Networking Standard</p>
        <p class="hongik">弘益人間 · Benefit All Humanity</p>
    </section>
    
    <div class="container">
        <div class="info-box">
            <div class="info-item"><div class="info-label">Chapters</div><div class="info-value">8</div></div>
            <div class="info-item"><div class="info-label">Pages</div><div class="info-value">~120</div></div>
            <div class="info-item"><div class="info-label">Version</div><div class="info-value">1.0</div></div>
            <div class="info-item"><div class="info-label">License</div><div class="info-value">MIT</div></div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="chapters">
            <a href="chapter-01.html" class="chapter-card"><div class="chapter-num">1</div><div class="chapter-info"><h3>Introduction</h3><p>The problem with fragmented social networks</p></div></a>
            <a href="chapter-02.html" class="chapter-card"><div class="chapter-num">2</div><div class="chapter-info"><h3>Universal Identity</h3><p>One identity across all platforms</p></div></a>
            <a href="chapter-03.html" class="chapter-card"><div class="chapter-num">3</div><div class="chapter-info"><h3>Cross-Platform Posting</h3><p>Write once, publish everywhere</p></div></a>
            <a href="chapter-04.html" class="chapter-card"><div class="chapter-num">4</div><div class="chapter-info"><h3>Unified Feed</h3><p>All your social feeds in one place</p></div></a>
            <a href="chapter-05.html" class="chapter-card"><div class="chapter-num">5</div><div class="chapter-info"><h3>Social Graph</h3><p>Your network across platforms</p></div></a>
            <a href="chapter-06.html" class="chapter-card"><div class="chapter-num">6</div><div class="chapter-info"><h3>Privacy & Security</h3><p>Protecting your digital identity</p></div></a>
            <a href="chapter-07.html" class="chapter-card"><div class="chapter-num">7</div><div class="chapter-info"><h3>Data Portability</h3><p>Your data, your control</p></div></a>
            <a href="chapter-08.html" class="chapter-card"><div class="chapter-num">8</div><div class="chapter-info"><h3>Implementation</h3><p>API and SDK reference</p></div></a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="cta">
            <p>Get the complete standard guide</p>
            <div class="price">$99 USD</div>
            <a href="https://wiabooks.store" class="btn" target="_blank">📚 Get on WIA Books</a>
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <footer class="footer">
        <p class="footer-hongik">弘益人間 (홍익인간)</p>
        <p>Benefit All Humanity</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 15px;"><a href="/social/">← Back to WIA Social</a> · <a href="/social/simulator/">Simulator</a></p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
